##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub #198: an ordinary Points primitive under the zbuffer hider with no Clipping statement. The point rasterizer read
# RASTER_UNSHADED from the global option flags, so with no Clipping it never shaded the point and drew it black.
# Same scene as matte-points-zbuffer.rib without Matte: the point must be the shader colour (0.9 0.1 0.1).
version 3.03
Hider "zbuffer" "jitter" [0]
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
Display "points-shaded-zbuffer.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 8 8 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 30
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Surface "constant"
  Color [0.9 0.1 0.1]
  Points "P" [0 0 0] "constantwidth" [1.5]
WorldEnd
